quest "The Lizquidation" version 1
order as-written
terrain (4, 4, 5)

repeat 10 as wave:
    at 1.5s + wave * 8s:
        burst template.lizard_random_2e at edge("east") copies wave + 6
        burst template.lizard_random_2e at edge("west") copies wave + 6
    if wave == 4:
        # as-written: listed with the fifth wave but due at 1.5s, so it lands a frame after the first.
        at 1.5s:
            burst alien.fast at edge("east", outside=128) copies 2
